### NGINX Rate Limiting via Limit_Req and Limit_Conn - Configuration Guide 001

limit_req_zone $binary_remote_addr zone=api:10m rate=10r/s implements the leaky bucket algorithm. Apply via limit_req zone=api burst=20 nodelay to smooth traffic bursts while dropping malicious spikes.

#### Production NGINX Directives #001
